    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10[b]">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Hl">Hl</ref> 10[b]</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne þæt nylle, gelde þonne C buton aðe, siþþan ane neaht ofer þæt gesem[eþ] hie.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he will not do that, let him then pay 100 without oath, after one night following their coming to arbitration.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he þonne þæt nille, gelde þonne C buton aðe, siþþan ane neaht ofer þæt gesem hie.</ab>
      </div>
